key.name:
There were beasts awakened within the Demon King's darkness, known as the
<font color="#ffd200">Baphomet Brothers</font>.
The eldest, <font color="#ffd200">$npc:23000026[gender:1]$</font>$pp:는,은$, possesses cruelty beyond description;
the second, <font color="#ffd200">$npc:23000025[gender:1]$</font>$pp:는,은$, overflows with wickedness;
and the third, <font color="#ffd200">$npc:23000024[gender:1]$</font>$pp:는,은$, tramples everything in a frenzy of madness.

After clearing dungeons and filling 30 weekly reward counts,
if you obtain <font color="#ffd200">$item:20301427$</font>,
I will give you <font color="#ffd200">$item:11800119$</font>, a gift for Halloween heroes!

